{"assets":["/statement-assets/94b150600c1969111d8262e545812cf7bfd6da0362284e97d4082a36cf744931.png","/statement-assets/48a7860c216e112b4fe4b00eaf8d123b3aa14384dce8ea6a3279e41407e3b725.png","/statement-assets/9f33d961f94b7a01331cc773d8149009a48a252f4aa2136afb82cfd8b4628e36.png","/statement-assets/d32782a0b9c7c70d396c8724f47bf795f6b46e6a2ab4cdd3bd8ea0e0dc56236a.png","/statement-assets/c075b9c421dca3cd40a5e93445a4fa18748770958c4bcdd1a7acbb22106d1559.png","/statement-assets/bafe87d793284fc2a8b65a2628a114b528078a02bd82f6f5a7ab470e22f3bc1c.png","/statement-assets/5e1e31ad0c1969a9f709337c4b6d3f869a7c846358d23b69dbd695854580226a.png","/statement-assets/5ee090fdb5e734978e361bde1d75f24b44e7fc9599684cfe9ee1a379efce19a3.png","/statement-assets/f398fb03df81462832f5c999b6eafad7189dd37825a66abb36e0c4cab9a8690d.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2120","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Square Pool"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Aryan and Harshith are playing pool in universe AX120 on a fixed square pool table of side $$$s$$$ with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pockets"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" at its $$$4$$$ corners. The corners are situated at $$$(0,0)$$$, $$$(0,s)$$$, $$$(s,0)$$$, and $$$(s,s)$$$. In this game variation, $$$n$$$ identical balls are placed on the table with integral coordinates such that no ball lies on the edge or corner of the table. Then, they are all simultaneously shot at $$$10^{100}$$$ units/sec speed (only at $$$45$$$ degrees with the axes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In universe AX120, balls and pockets are almost point-sized, and the collisions are elastic, i.e., the ball, on hitting any surface, bounces off at the same angle and with the same speed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/94b150600c1969111d8262e545812cf7bfd6da0362284e97d4082a36cf744931.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Harshith shot the balls, and he provided Aryan with the balls' positions and the angles at which he shot them. Help Aryan determine the number of balls potted into the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pockets"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" by Harshith."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that multiple collisions do not occur at the same moment and position."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$s$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^3$$$, $$$2 \\le s\\le 10^9$$$) — the number of balls placed on the table and the side length of the square pool table."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains four integers $$$d_x$$$, $$$d_y$$$, $$$x_i$$$, and $$$y_i$$$ ($$$d_x,d_y \\in \\{-1, 1\\}$$$, $$$0 \\lt x_i, y_i \\lt s$$$) — the direction vectors of the launch on the $$$X$$$-axis and $$$Y$$$-axis respectively, and the coordinates of the location where the $$$i$$$-th ball was placed. It is guaranteed that no two balls coincide at the initial moment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is also guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print a single integer — the number of balls potted in that game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 2\n1 1 1 1\n5 4\n1 -1 1 1\n1 -1 2 2\n-1 1 2 3\n1 -1 1 3\n-1 1 3 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there is a single ball and it's shot directly towards the pocket at $$$(2, 2)$$$, thus potted."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the state progresses as"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/48a7860c216e112b4fe4b00eaf8d123b3aa14384dce8ea6a3279e41407e3b725.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\rightarrow$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9f33d961f94b7a01331cc773d8149009a48a252f4aa2136afb82cfd8b4628e36.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d32782a0b9c7c70d396c8724f47bf795f6b46e6a2ab4cdd3bd8ea0e0dc56236a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\rightarrow$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c075b9c421dca3cd40a5e93445a4fa18748770958c4bcdd1a7acbb22106d1559.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/bafe87d793284fc2a8b65a2628a114b528078a02bd82f6f5a7ab470e22f3bc1c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\rightarrow$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/5e1e31ad0c1969a9f709337c4b6d3f869a7c846358d23b69dbd695854580226a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/5ee090fdb5e734978e361bde1d75f24b44e7fc9599684cfe9ee1a379efce19a3.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\rightarrow$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f398fb03df81462832f5c999b6eafad7189dd37825a66abb36e0c4cab9a8690d.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind"